msgctxt "whats-new:2.0:Parent"
msgid "### New Features\n- **Fedora Support**: Fedora Workstation 44 and 45 are now officially supported!\n- **Parent App**: Feedback and error reporting prompts for reply email but still does not require it\n- **Child App**: Tamper-free child app - automatically restores the child extension when disabled, with retry backoff and standard error reporting for failures.\n  \n### Bug Fixes\n- **Child App**: Fixed an unnecessary error report blocking the time request after locking during parent approval.\n\n### Robustness and Reliability Improvements\nThis release further improves system resilience by addressing several edge cases identified through automated end-to-end stress testing. While the simulated test scenarios are very unlikely to occur during everyday use, these improvements help ensure more reliable operation under unexpected conditions.\n\n- **Kiosk:** Prevented an unusable kiosk session when selecting the Oh No! Parent Control session type at login. The system now safely returns to the user selection screen without requiring a reboot.\n- **Broker:** Improved handling of child account deletion while the GNOME extension monitor is still monitoring the account, preventing unnecessary errors.\n- **Broker:** Improved countdown reliability when the Malcontent timer service is slow to respond after waking from sleep or restarting.\n- **Broker:** Improved handling of concurrent screen-lock and time-request events, ensuring that pending approvals are gracefully cancelled rather than displaying an error.\n- **Parent App** — Pauses background refreshes during shutdown or restart to avoid spurious errors as system services stop.\n- **Screen Time** — Retries extension recovery once if the previous desktop session closes while a child is signing back in or a parent is loading that child’s settings.\n- **Screen Time** — Checks directly with the child’s desktop that the extension is running, so verification can succeed even if GNOME’s extension helper stops or restarts.\n- **Screen Time** — Retries and verifies restoration of the child’s original GNOME extension settings if the session disconnects during recovery.\n\n### Non Product Changes\n- Increases VM tests to total of 249 installed system + E2E cases per distro family, Ubuntu24.04, Fedora44, Fedora45.\n\n"
msgstr "### Yangi imkoniyatlar\n- **Fedora tizimini qoʻllab-quvvatlash**: Fedora Workstation 44 va 45 endi rasman qoʻllab-quvvatlanadi!\n- **Ota-ona ilovasi**: Fikr-mulohaza yuborish va xatolar haqida xabar berishda ilova javob uchun elektron pochta manzilini soʻraydi. Manzilni kiritish hamon ixtiyoriy.\n- **Bola ilovasi**: Ilova ruxsatsiz oʻzgartirishlardan himoyalangan. Bola kengaytmasi oʻchirib qoʻyilsa, ilova uni avtomatik tiklaydi, qayta urinishlar orasidagi kutish vaqtini uzaytiradi va tiklash muvaffaqiyatsiz boʻlsa, standart tartibda xato haqida xabar beradi.\n  \n### Xatolar tuzatildi\n- **Bola ilovasi**: Ota-ona soʻrovni tasdiqlayotgan paytda ekran qulflangach, qoʻshimcha vaqt soʻrovini toʻsib qoʻygan keraksiz xato xabari bartaraf etildi.\n\n### Barqarorlik va ishonchlilik yaxshilandi\nUshbu reliz boshidan oxirigacha bajariladigan avtomatlashtirilgan yuklama sinovlarida aniqlangan bir nechta kam uchraydigan holatni tuzatish orqali tizim barqarorligini yanada oshiradi. Sinovda modellashtirilgan holatlar kundalik foydalanishda yuz berishi ehtimoli juda past, ammo bu yaxshilanishlar tizimning kutilmagan sharoitlarda ishonchliroq ishlashiga yordam beradi.\n\n- **Kiosk:** Tizimga kirishda Oh No! Parent Control seans turi tanlansa, endi foydalanib boʻlmaydigan kiosk seansi ochilmaydi. Tizim qayta yuklashga hojat qolmasdan foydalanuvchini tanlash ekraniga xavfsiz qaytadi.\n- **Vositachi:** GNOME kengaytmasi kuzatuvchisi bola hisobini hali kuzatib turgan paytda hisobni oʻchirish jarayoni yaxshilandi. Bu ortiqcha xatolarning oldini oladi.\n- **Vositachi:** Tizim uyqu rejimidan chiqqanidan yoki qayta ishga tushganidan keyin Malcontent taymer xizmati sekin javob bersa ham, teskari sanoq ishonchliroq ishlaydi.\n- **Vositachi:** Ekran qulflanishi va qoʻshimcha vaqt soʻrovi bir vaqtda yuz berganda ularni qayta ishlash yaxshilandi. Tasdiqlanishi kutilayotgan soʻrovlar xato koʻrsatilmasdan tartibli ravishda bekor qilinadi.\n- **Ota-ona ilovasi** — Tizim oʻchirilayotganda yoki qayta ishga tushirilayotganda fon rejimidagi yangilashlarni vaqtincha toʻxtatadi. Bu tizim xizmatlari toʻxtayotganda asossiz xatolarning oldini oladi.\n- **Ekran vaqti** — Bola tizimga qayta kirayotganida yoki ota-ona shu bolaning sozlamalarini yuklayotganida oldingi ish stoli seansi yopilsa, kengaytmani tiklashga yana bir marta urinadi.\n- **Ekran vaqti** — Kengaytma ishlayotganini bevosita bolaning ish stoli orqali tekshiradi. Shu sababli GNOME kengaytmalarining yordamchi komponenti toʻxtasa yoki qayta ishga tushsa ham, tekshiruv muvaffaqiyatli oʻtishi mumkin.\n- **Ekran vaqti** — Tiklash vaqtida seans uzilib qolsa, bolaning dastlabki GNOME kengaytmalari sozlamalarini tiklashga yana urinadi va sozlamalar tiklanganini tekshiradi.\n\n### Mahsulotga oid boʻlmagan oʻzgarishlar\n- Virtual mashina sinovlari soni distribyutiv oilasi boshiga jami 249 ta holatga yetkazildi. Bunga Ubuntu24.04, Fedora44 va Fedora45 uchun oʻrnatilgan tizim sinovlari hamda boshidan oxirigacha bajariladigan sinovlar (E2E) kiradi.\n\n"
